{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09894","headline":"首春渭西郊行呈蓝田张二主簿 · 岑参","name":"首春渭西郊行呈蓝田张二主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迥风度雨渭城西，细草新花踏作泥。\n秦女峰头雪未尽，胡公阪上日初低。\n愁窥白发羞微禄，悔别青山忆旧谿。\n闻道辋川多胜事，玉壶春酒正堪携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}